## 🎯 PROJECT OVERVIEW


**Name:** Arabic Conversation Practice (working title)
**Type:** **Hybrid monorepo** — client mobile **React Native (Expo)** + backend / API **Next.js** (App Router). Le site web Next.js peut rester pour landing/admin ou être réduit ; l’app native est la cible produit principale.
**Purpose:** AI-powered conversational Arabic learning platform with immersive scenarios
**Target Users:** French/English speakers learning Modern Standard Arabic (MSA) or Moroccan Darija
**Unique Selling Points:**
- Halal-compliant gestural avatar (NO face/eyes)
- Real-time corrections during conversation
- Adaptive difficulty based on user progress
- Immersive scenarios with evolving backgrounds
- Bilingual: MSA + Moroccan Darija

